    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "legend",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 770,
      "width": 1040,
      "height": 24,
      "text": "Read left-to-right by custody: calendar clocks \u2192 task surface \u2192 priority model \u2192 dispatch machinery. Red/purple/yellow boxes are where \u201cliveness\u201d is easiest to misread: a date, a declared priority, or a recurring ritual can each masquerade as capacity.",
